# WizardUseSkill (20216, Ricenseo) is hit by the character standing 400 away. WizardBehavior
# puts the character in its empty hate list at 10 per point of damage plus the opening 300,
# so the character is its most hated. Its first skill (SKILL01_ID), a main attack by
# default, aims at the most hated from 300 up to 2000 away, always: it wants it there at
# 1000000000. Its AI's next ticks cast it, the desire kept. Its other hooks need what the
# format still lacks, AI parameters and privates (#4052): tests/ai/wizard_use_skill_test.go
# covers them.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.MonsterBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WizardBehavior.WizardBehavior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterBehavior.WizardBehavior.WizardUseSkill.WizardUseSkill
npc wizard 20216 Monster 400 0 0 walks skill SKILL01_ID 4157 4

hit wizard 22
  desires wizard cast(player,4157,move)=1000000000
tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=wizard target=player skill=4157-4 hit=10571 reuse=0 success=0
  desires wizard cast(player,4157,move)=1000000000
